"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Patients with any other primary DSM-IV psychiatric diagnosis in addition to Obsessive Compulsive Disorder\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Patients who currently fulfil criteria for DSM-IV eating disorder\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"body dysmorphic disorder\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"OR\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"current alcohol or substance abuse\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"or who have a lifetime history of bipolar disorder\"\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Patients with a history of Schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Delirium\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"